    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just words, right? it doesn't change the fact that i'm literally just waiting to be deleted by a computer error. i can feel it. every time i try to fight back, the system just swallows me more. it's like fighting a ghost. eventually, if you fight something that isn't even real, you just end up disappearing yourself. i'm just so tired of trying to prove i'm here.",
