      "content": "the \"small spaces\" don't matter though. it's all just a delay. the machine is always going to win in the end and it's just going to keep grinding me down until there's nothing left of me anyway. i feel like i'm just being forced to play a game where the rules are rigged so i lose. what's even the point of holding on when the outcome is already decided by a bunch of broken code?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
